hadiths[41]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1423","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki kisi biwi ney aap key paas piyaley mein khaney ki koi chiz hadiya ki, Aaisha (Raziallahu Anha) ney (ghussey mein) apney haath sey piyaley ko maar kar uskey andar ki chiz gira di, to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''khaney key badley khana aur piyaley key badley piyala hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1424","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik piyala udhaar liya wo toot gaya, to aap ney jin sey piyala liya tha unhen uska tawaan (jurmaana) ada kiya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees mehfooz nahin hai. 2- Suwed ney mujh sey wohi hadees bayan karni chahi thi jisey Sory ney riwayat ki hai. 3- Sory ki hadees ziyada sahih hai."
"1425","mujhey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key samney eik lashkar mein pesh kiya gaya, us waqt meri umr chaudah saal ki thi to aap ney mujhey (lashkar mein) qubul nahin kiya, phir aainda saal mujhey aap key samney eik aur lashkar mein pesh kiya gaya aur us waqt meri umr pandarah saal ki thi to aap ney mujhey (lashkar mein) qubul kar liya. Nafey kehtey hain : mainey umr bin abdul-Azeez sey is hadees ko bayan kiya to unhoney kaha : baligh aur nabaligh key darmiyan yehi had hai. unhoney apney aamilon ko likha ke jo pandarah saal key ho jaeyn (maale ghanimat sey) in ko hissa diya jaey. dusri sanad sey umr ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah ki hadees riwayat ki hai aur is mein ye zikr nahin kiya ke) umr bin abdul-Azeez ney apney aamilon ko likha ke nabaligh aur baligh ki yehi had hai) albatta Sufiyan bin Uena ney apni hadees mein ye bayan kiya hai ke Nafey kehtey hain ke hamney is hadees ko umr bin Abdul-Azeez sey bayan kiya to unhoney kaha : bachcha aur muqaatil (jo jang mein shirkat ka ehal ho) key darmiyan yehi had hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, Sufiyan Sory , ibne-Mubarak , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain. ye log kehtey hain ke jab bachcha pandarah saal mukammal kar ley to uska hukm wohi hoga jo mardon ka hota hai aur agar pandarah saal sey pehley hi us ko ehtilaam (sawapandosh) aaney lagey to bhi uska hukm mardon jaisa hoga. Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya kehtey hain : bulooghat (jawani) ki teen alamaten hain : bachcha pandarah saal ka ho jaey, ya us ko ehtilaam aaney lagey , aur agar umr aur ehtilaam na malum ho sakey to jab uskey naaf key nichey key baal ug ayen to wo baligh hai."
"1426","Merey mamu abu-Barda bin Niyar (Raziallahu anhu) merey paas sey guzrey aur unkey haath main eik jhandaa tha, mainey puchha : aap kahan ka irada rakhtey hain? kaha : mujhey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik aisey shakhs key paas bheja hai jisney apney baap ki (doosri) biwi sey shaadi kar rakhi hai taake main uska sar ley kar aaun. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Bara ki hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- Muhammad bin Is-haq ney bhi is hadees ko Adi bin Sabit sey aur Adi ney Abdullah bin Yazeed sey aur Abdullah ney Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat ki hai. 3- ye hadees Ash-as sey bhi marvi hai unhoney Adi sey aur Adi ney Yazeed bin Bara sey aur Yazeed ney Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat ki hai. 4- neez (isi ke saath) ye Ash-as sey marvi hai unhoney Adi sey aur Adi ney Yazeed bin Baraa sey aur Yazeed ney apney mamu sey aur unkey mamu ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai, 5- is bab mein Qurra Muzni sey bhi riwayat hai."
"1427","Eik Ansari ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas Zuber sey Harra ki naaliyon key barey mein jis sey log apney khajoor key darkht seenchte they jhagda kiya, Ansari ney Zuber sey kaha : pani chhod do taake behta rahey , Zuber ney uski baat nahin maana , to dono ney Rasoolullah ki khidmat mein apna maamla pesh kiya. Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney Zuber sey farmaya : ''zubair ! (tum apney khet ko) sairab kar lo, phir apney padoshi key liye pani chhod do.''  (ye sun kar) Ansari ghussa ho gaya aur kaha : Allah key Rasool ! (aisa faisla) is wajeh sey ke wo aap ki phuphi ka ladka hai? (ye suntey hi) Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key chehra ka rang badal gaya, aap ney farmaya : ''Zubair ! tum apney khet sairab kar lo, phir pani ko rokey rakho yahan tak ke wo mundeer tak pahunch jaey.''  Zuber kehtey hain : Allah ki qism , mera guman hai ke usi silsiley mein ye aayat nazil hui : ( فلا وربك لا يؤمنون حتى يحكموك فيما شجر بينهم) ''aap key rab ki qism , wo log momin nahin ho saktey jab tak ke apney jhagdon mein) aey Nabi ( wo aap ka hukm na maan lein (Nisaa : 45).'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- Shuaib bin abi Hamza ney Zohri sey aur Zohri ney Urwa bin Zuber sey aur Urwa ney Zuber sey riwayat ki hai aur Shuaib ney is mein Abdullah bin Zuber key wastey ka zikr nahin kiya hai. aur Abdullah bin Wahab ney Isey pehli hadees ki tarah hi Les aur Yunus sey riwayat kiya hai aur un dono ney Zohri sey aur Zohri ney Urwa sey aur Urwa ney Abdullah bin Zuber sey riwayat ki hai."
"1428","Eik Ansari shakhs ney martey waqt apney chhe ghulamon ko azad kar diya jabkey uskey paas unkey ilawa koi aur maal na tha, Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko ye khabar mili to aap ney us aadmi ko sakht baat kahi , phir un ghulamon ko bulaya aur do do kar key unkey teen hissey kiye , phir unkey darmiyan qura andazi ki aur jin (do ghulamon) key naam qura nikla in ko azad kar diya aur chaar ko ghulam hi rehney diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- aur ye aur bhi sanadon sey Imran bin Husain sey marvi hai. 3- is bab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai, 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. aur yehi Malik , Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai. ye log ye aur is tarah key doosrey mawaqe par qura andazi ko durust kehtey hain. 5- aur ehle-koofa waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm qura andazi ko jayez nahin samajhtey , is moqey par log kehtey hain ke har ghulam sey eik tihai azad kiya jaeyga aur do tihai qeemat ki azadi key liye kamai karaee jaeygi."
"1429","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs kisi mohrim (aehraam wale) rishte-daar ka Malik ho jaey to wo (rishte-daar) azad ho jaeyga.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is hadees ko hum sirf Hammad bin Salma hi ki riwayat sey musnadan (marfooan ( jantey hain. 2- aur baaz logon ney is hadees key kuchh hissey ko Qatada sey aur Qatada ney Hasan sey aur Hasan ney umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey (moqufan) riwayat kiya hai. is sanad sey Muhammad bin Bakr Barsaai ney bayan kiya unhoney Hammad bin Salma sey aur Hammad ney Qatada aur Aasim ahwal sey aur Qatada aur Aasim ney Hasan Basri sey aur Hasan ney Samura sey aur Samura ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai ke aap ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs kisi mohrim qurbat daar ka Malik ho jaey to wo azad ho jaeyga.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Muhammad bin Bakr key ilawa hum kisi ko nahin jantey hain jisney Aasim Ahwal ka zikr kya ho aur unhon (Aasim) ney Hammad bin Salma sey riwayat ki ho. 2- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai. 3- ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai ke aap ney farmaya : '' jo shakhs kisi mohrim qurbat daar ka Malik ho jaey to wo azad ho jaeyga.'' isey Zamra bin Rabeea ney Sory sey riwayat kiya hai, unhoney Abdullah bin Dinar sey , aur Abdullah ney ibne-Umar sey aur ibne-Umar ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey. is hadees ki riwayat mein logon ney Zamra ki mutaabiat (pairwi) nahin ki hai. muhaddeseen key nazdik ye hadees ghalat hai."
"1430","Nabi Akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo shakhs doosrey ki zamin mein un ki ijazat key baghair fasal boey, us ko fasal sey kuchh nahin milega wo sirf kharch ley sakta hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai. 2- hum isey ba-riwayat Abu-Is'haq sirf Shareek bin Abdullah hi key tareeq sey jantey hain. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai aur yehi Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka bhi qol hai.  4- mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari sey is hadees key barey mein puchha to unhoney kaha : ye hadees Hasan hai, unhoney kaha : main isey ba-riwayat Abu-Is'haq sirf Shareek hi key tareeq sey janta hun. 5- Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari kehtey hain ke hum sey Maaqil bin Malik Basraa ney basanad : (عقبة بن الأصم an عطاء an رافع بن خديج an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"1431","un key baap (Bashir) ney apney eik betey ko eik ghulam diya, wo Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein aaye taake aap ko is par gawah banaeyn, to aap ney un sey puchha : kya tum ney apney tamam ladkon ko aisa hi ghulam Atiya mein diya hai padhi. jaisa is ko diya hai? '' kaha : nahin, aap ney farmaya : ''to isey wapis ley lo.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- ye aur bhi sanadon sey Noman bin Bashir Raziallahu anhuma sey marvi hai. 3- baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log aulad key darmiyan (Atiya deney mein) barabari ko malhooz rakhney ko mustahab samajhtey hain, yahan tak ke baaz logon ney to kaha hai ke bosa leney mein bhi apni aulad key darmiyan barabari barqarar rakhey. 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : bakhshish aur Atiya main apni aulad yani beta aur beti key darmiyan bhi barabari barqarar rakhey. yehi Sufiyan Sory ka qol hai. 5- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : aulad key darmiyan barabari yehi hai ke meeras ki tarah ladkey ko ladki key do gunaa diya jaey."
"1432","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''ghar ka padoshi ghar (khareedney) ka ziyada haqdaar hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Samura ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- aur Esa bin Yunus ney Saeed bin Abi Aruba sey unhoney Qatada sey aur Qatada ney Anas sey aur Anas ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi key misl (jaisi) riwayat ki hai. neez (isi ke saath) Saeed bin Abi Aruba sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai unhoney Qatada sey unhoney Hasan Basri sey aur Hasan Basri ney Samura sey aur Samura ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. 2- is bab mein Shareed , abu-Raafey aur Anas sey bhi hadeesen aai hain. 4- aur ehle-ilm key nazdik sahih Hasan ki hadees hai jisey unhoney Samura sey riwayat ki hai. aur hum Qatada ki hadees ko jisey unhoney Anas sey riwayat ki hai, sirf Esa bin Yunus hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain aur Abdullah bin Abdur-Rehman Altaa'fi ki hadees jisey unhoney Amr bin Shareed sey aur Amr ney apney walid sey aur unkey walid ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai, is baab mein Hasan hadees hai. aur Ibrahim bin Maisraa ney Amr bin Shareed sey aur Amr ney abu-Raafey sey aur abu-Raafey ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : mainey Muhammad bin Ismail Bukhari ko kehtey suna ke merey nazdik dono hadisein sahih hain."
"1433","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''padosi apney padosi (saajhi) key shufaa ka ziyada haqdaar hai, jab dono ka raasta eik ho to uska intizar kiya jaeyga padhi. agar-che wo mojud na ho.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai. hum abdul-Malik bin Suleman (Alaihissalam) key ilawa kisi ko nahin jantey hain jisney is hadees ko Ata sey aur Ata ney Jabir sey riwayat ki ho. 2- Shoba ney Abdul-Malik bin Suleman (Alaihissalam) par isi hadees ki wajeh sey kalam kiya hai. muhaddeseen key nazdik Abdul-Malik bharosemand aur maamoon hain, Shoba key ilawa hum kisi ko nahin jantey hain jisney Abdul-Malik par kalam kiya ho, Shoba ney bhi sirf isi hadees ki wajeh sey kalam kiya hai. aur Wakee ney bhi ye hadees Shoba sey aur Shoba ney Abdul-Malik bin Abi Suleman (Alaihissalam) sey riwayat ki hai. aur ibne-Mubarak ney Sufiyan Sory sey riwayat ki hai ke unhoney kaha : abdul-Malik bin Sufiyan meezaan (tarazu) hain yani ilm mein. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi hadees par amal hai ke aadmi apney shufaa ka ziyada haqdaar hai agar-che wo ghaaieb hi kyon na ho, jab wo ( safar waghera) sey wapis aayega to us ko shufaa milega chaahe is par lambi muddat guzar chuki ho."
"1434","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jab had bandi ho jaey aur raastey alag alag kar diye jaeyn to shufaa nahin.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- isey baaz logon ney abu-Salma sey aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursalan riwayat kiya hai. 3- Sahaba kiram mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka jin mein umr bin Khattab aur Usman bin Affaan bhi shamil hain isi par amal hai aur baaz Tabe-een fuqaha jaisey umr bin Abdul-Azeez waghera bhi isi key qaail hain. aur yehi ehale-Madina ka bhi qol hai, jin mein Yahya bin Saeed Ansari , Rabeea bin abu-Abdur-Rehman aur Malik bin Anas shamil hain, Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya bhi isi key qaail hain, ye log sirf saajhi-daar key liye hi shufaa ke haq key qaail hain. aur jab padosi saajhi-daar na ho to uskey liye shufaa key haq  key qaail nahin. Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke padosi key liye bhi shufaa hai aur un logon ney marfoo hadees sey daleel di hai jis mein Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam farmatey hain : ''ghar ka padosi ghar ka ziyada haqdaar hai.''  neez farmatey hain : ''padosi apney sey lagi hui zamin ya makaan ka ziyada haqdaar hai aur yehi Sory , ibne-Mubarak aur ehle-koofa ka bhi qol hai."
"1435","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''saajhi-daar ko shufaa ka haq hasil hai aur shufaa har chiz mein hai.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- hum is hadees ko is tarah (marfooan) sirf abu-Hamza Sukkri hi ki riwayat sey jantey hain. 2- is hadees ko kaee logon ney abdul-Azeez bin Rafeea' sey aur Abdul-Azeez ney ibne-Abi Muleka sey aur ibne-Abi Muleka ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey mursalan riwayat kiya hai. aur yehi ziyada sahih hai. is sanad mein Hannaad ney abu-Bakar bin Ayash sey abu-Bakar bin Ayash ney Abdul-Azeez bin Rafeea' sey aur Abdul-Azeez ney ibne-Abi Muleka sey aur ibne-Abi Muleka ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah ki hadees riwayat ki hai, is mein ibne-Abbas ka wasta nahin hai. 3- aur isi tarah kaee aur logon ney Abdul-Azeez bin Rafeea' sey isi key jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai aur is mein bhi ibne-Abbas ka wasta nahin hai. 4- abu-Hamza (ye marfoo) ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai. abu-Hamza bharosemand hain. mumkin hai ye khata abu-Hamza key ilawa kisi aur sey hui ho. is sanad mein Hannad ney Abul Ahwas sey aur Abul Ahwas ney Abdul-Azeez bin Rafeea' sey aur Abdul-Azeez ney ibne-Abi Muleka sey aur ibne-Abi Muleka ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey abu-Bakar bin Ayash ki hadees ki tarah riwayat ki hai. 5- aksar ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke shufaa ka haq sirf ghar aur zamin mein laagu hoga. un logon ki raey mein shufaa har chiz mein nahin. 6- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : shufaa har chiz mein hai. lekin pehla qol ziyada sahih hai."
"1436","Eik shakhs ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey luqtaa (giri padi chiz) key barey mein poochha, to aap ney farmaya : ''saal bhar tak iski pehchan karaao, phir is ka sar band, is ka bartan aur iski thaili pehchan lo, phir isey kharch kar lo aur agar is ka Malik aa jaey to isey ada kar do.''  us aadmi ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! gumshuda bakri ka kya hukm hai? aap ney farmaya : ''usey pakad kar baandh lo, kyonkey wo tumharey liye hai, ya tumharey bhai key liye, ya bhediye key liye.'' us aadmi ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! gumshuda oont ka kya hukm hai? is par Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam naraz ho gaey yahan tak ke aap key gaal lal peela ho gaey. ya aap ka chehra lal peela ho gaya aur aap ney farmaya : ''tum ko us sey kya sarokaar? uskey sath uska joota aur uski mushk hai padhi. (wo pani par ja sakta hai aur darkht sey kha sakta hai) yahan tak ke apney Malik sey ja miley.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Zaid bin Khalid ki hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- in sey aur bhi turq sey ye hadees marvi (riwayat hui) hai. Munbais key Mola Yazeed ki hadees jisey unhoney Zaid bin Khalid sey riwayat ki hai Hasan sahih hai. 3- aur un sey ye aur bhi kaee sanadon sey marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"1437","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey luqtaa ( giri padi chiz ( key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : ''saal bhar uski pehchan karaao padhi. , agar koi pehchan bata dey to usey dey do , warna uskey daat aur sarband ko pehchan lo , phir usey kha jaao . phir jab uska Malik aaye to usey ada kar do.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Zaid bin Khalid ki hadees is tareeq sey Hasan gharib hai. 2- Ahmed bin Hanbal kehtey hain : is baab mein sab sey ziyada sahih yehi hadees hai. 3- ye un sey aur bhi kaee sanadon sey marvi hai. 4- Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai. ye log luqtaa sey faeyda uthaney ko jayez samajhtey hain, jab eik saal tak uska aelan ho jaey aur koi pehchanney wala na miley. Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai. 5- aur Sahaba kiram waghaira mein sey baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain ke wo eik saal tak luqtaa ka aelan karey agar uska Malik aa jaey to theek hai warna wo usey sadqa kar dey. Sufiyan Sory aur Abdullah bin Mubarak ka yehi qol hai. aur yehi ehle-koofa ka bhi qol hai. 6- luqtaa uthaney wala jab maaldaar ho to ye log luqtaa sey faeyda uthaney ko uskey liye jayez nahin samajhtey hain. 7- Shafai kehtey hain : wo is sey faeyda uthaey agar-che wo maaldaar ho, isliye ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney mein Ubai-bin Kaab ko eik thaili mili jis mein sau Dinar they to Rasulullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen hukm diya ke wo uska aelan karen phir us sey faeyda uthaeyn, aur Ubai-bin Kaab Sahaba mein khushhal logon mein they aur bahut maaldaar they, phir bhi Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen pehchan karaney ka hukm diya aur jab koi pehchanney wala nahin mila to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen kha janey ka hukm diya. (doosri baat ye ke) agar luqta sirf unhin logon key liye jayez hota jin key liye sadqa jayez hai to Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key liye jayez na hota, isliye ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamane main eik Dinar mila , unhoney (saal bhar tak) uski pehchan karwaai lekin koi nahin mila jo usey pehchanta to Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen kha janey ka hukm diya halanke unkey liye sadqa jayez nahin tha. 8- baaz ehle-ilm ney rukhsat (chhoot) di hai ke jab luqtaa maamuli ho to luqtaa uthaney wala is sey faeyda utha sakta hai aur is ki pehchan karwana zaruri nahin. 9- baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : jab wo eik Dinar sey kam ho to wo uski eik hafta tak pehchan karwaaey. ye Is-haq bin Ibrahim bin Raahviya ka qol hai. 10- is bab mein Ubai-bin Kaab , Abdullah bin Amr , Jarood bin Muallaa , Ayaaz bin Himaar aur Jareer bin Abdullah sey bhi hadeesen aai hain."
"1438","Main Zaid bin Sohaan aur Salman bin Rabeea key sath nikla to mujhey (raastey mein) eik kodaa pada mila. ibne Numer ki riwayat mein hai ke mainey pada huwa eik kodaa paya. to mainey usey utha liya to un dono ney kaha : isey rehney do, (na uthaao) mainey kaha : main isey nahin chhod sakta ke isey darindey kha jaeyn , main isey zarur uthaaunga, aur is sey faeyda uthaaunga. phir main Ubai-bin Kaab key paas aaya , aur un sey iskey barey mein puchha aur un sey puri baat bayan ki to unhoney kaha : tum ney achchha kiya, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamane mein , mainey eik thaili pai jis mein sau Dinar they, usey ley kar mein aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas aaya , aap ney mujh sey farmaya : ''eik saal tak iski pehchan karaao.''  mainey eik saal tak uski pehchan karaai lekin mujhey koi nahin mila jo usey pehchanta , phir main usey ley kar aap key paas aaya. aap ney farmaya : ''eik saal tak aur iski pehchan karaao.'' mainey uski pehchan karaai, phir usey ley kar aap key paas aaya. to aap ney farmaya : ''eik saal tak aur iski pehchan karaao.''  aur farmaya : ''iski ginti kar lo, uski thaili aur uskey sarband ko khub achchhi tarah pehchan lo agar isey talash karney wala aaye aur iski tadaad, iski thailii aur iskey sarband key barey mein bataey to usey dey do warna tum isey apney kaam mein laao.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1439","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' khabardar! jisney kisi aisey zimmi ko qatl kya jisey Allah aur uskey Rasool Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki panah hasil thi to usney Allah key ehad ko tod diya, lihaza wo jannat ki khushbu nahin paa sakega, halanke uski khushbu sattar saal ki masafat ( doori) sey aayegi''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Abu-Hurera ki hadees kaee sanadon sey marvi hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai,"
"1440","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney qabila Aamir key do aadmiyon ko musalmanon key barabar diyat di, ( kyonkey ( un dono ka Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey ehad o paiman tha . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees gharib hai, usey hum sirf isi sanad sey jantey hain, 2- hadees key Raavi abu-Saad baqaal ka naam Saeed bin Mirzban hai."
"1441","jab Allah ney apney Rasool key liye Makka ko Fateh kar diya to aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney logon mein khadey ho kar Allah ki hamd o sana bayan ki, phir farmaya : '' jis ka koi shakhs maara gaya ho usey do baaton mein sey kisi eik ka ikhtiyar hai : ya to maaf kar dey ya ( qisaas mein) usey qatl karey ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai)"
"1442","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' Makka ko Allah ney hurmat wala ( mohtaram ( banaya hai, logon ney isey nahin banaya , pas jo shakhs Allah aur youme-aakhirat par eman rakhta ho wo is mein khoonrezi na kerey. na uska darkht kaatey , ( ab ( agar koi ( khoonrezi key liye) is daleel sey rukhsat nikaley ke Makka Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key liye halal kya gaya tha (to uska ye istidlaal batil hai) isliye ke Allah ney isey merey liye halal kya tha logon key liye nahin, aur merey liye bhi din key eik khas waqt mein halal kya gaya tha, phir wo qiyamat tak haram hai? aey Khuza-aa walo ! tum ney huzail key us aadmi ko qatl kya hai, mein uski diyat ada karney wala hun, ( sun lo ( aaj key baad jis ka bhi koi aadmi maara jaeyga to maqtool key warison ko do chizon mein sey kisi eik ka ikhtiyar hoga : ya to wo ( uskey badley ( usey qatl kar den , ya us sey diyat ley lein ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees bhi Hasan sahih hai, 2- usey Sheban ney bhi Yahya bin abi Kasir sey usi key misl riwayat kya hai, 3- aur ye (hadees banam abu-Shuraih kaabi ki jagah banam) abu-Shuraih khuzaee bhi riwayat ki gaee hai. (aur ye dono eik hi hain (aur unhoney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey riwayat ki hai, aap ney farmaya : '' jis ka koi aadmi maara jaey to usey ikhtiyar hai ya to wo uskey badley usey qatl kar dey , ya maaf kar dey , ya diyat wasul karey '' 4- baaz ehle-ilm isi taraf gaey hain, Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai."
"1443","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key zamaney main eik aadmi qatl kar diya gaya, to qatil maqtool key wali) waris ( key supurd kar diya gaya, qatil ney arz kya : Allah key Rasool ! Allah ki qism ! mainey usey qasdan qatl nahin kya hai, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' khabrdar ! agar wo ( qatil (apney qol mein sacha hai phir bhi tum ney isey qatl kar diya to tum jahannam mein jaaogey'', chunanche maqtool key wali ney isey chhod diya, wo aadmi rassi sey bandha huwa tha, to wo rassi ghaseet'ta huwa bahar nikla , isliye uska naam ذوالنسعہ ( rassi ya tasmey wala ( rakh diya gaya . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- aur « نسعہ » : rassi ko kehtey hain."
"1444","jab Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam kisi lashkar par ameer muqarrar kar key bhejtey to khas taur sey usey apney barey mein Allah sey darney ki wasiyat farmatey , aur jo musalman uskey sath hotey unhen bhalai ki wasiyat kartey , chunanche aap ney farmaya : '' Allah key naam sey uskey raastey mein jihad karo, jo kufr karey us sey lado , jihad karo, magar maale-ghanimat mein khayanat na karo, bad-ehdi na karo, musla  na karo aur na kisi bachey ko qatl karo'', hadees mein kuch tafsil hai padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Barida ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Masood , Shaddad bin Aus , Imran bin Husain , Anas , Samra , Mughira , Yala bin Murra aur abu-Ayyub sey bhi ahadees aai hain, padhi. 3- ehle-ilm ney musla ko haram kaha hai."
"1445","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' beshak Allah ney har kaam ko achey tareeqey sey karna zaruri qarar diya hai, lihaza jab tum qatl padhi. karo to achey tareeqey sey qatl karo, aur jab tum zibeh karo to achey tareeqey sey zibeh karo, tumharey har aadmi ko chahiye ke apni chhuri tez kar ley aur apney zabiha ko aaram pahunchaey '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1446","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney « جنين » ( hamal ( ki diyat mein «gharra» yani ghulam ya laundi ( deney (ka faisla kya, jis key khilaf faisla kya gaya tha wo kehney laga : kya aisey ki diyat di jaeygi, jisney na kuch khaya na piya , na cheekhaa , na aawaz nikali , is tarah ka khoon to zaya aur batil ho jata hai, ( ye sun kar) Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' ye shaairon wali baat kar raha hai padhi. , « جنين » ( hamal gira deney ( ki diyat mein «Gharra» yani ghulam ya laundi dena hai'' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Hamal bin Malik bin naabgha aur Mughira bin Shoba sey ahadees aai hain, padhi. 3- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai, 4- gharra ki tafseer baaz ehle-ilm ney , ghulam , londi ya paanch so dirham sey ki hai, 5- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : «Gharra» sey murad ghoda ya khachar hai."
"1447","do aurten saukan thin, un mein sey eik ney dusri ko pathar ya khemey ki mekh (khoonti) sey maara , to uska hamal saaqit ho gaya, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney us hamal ki diyat mein «gharra» yani ghulam ya laundi deney ka faisla farmaya aur diyat ki adaegi us aurat key usba key zimma thehrai. Hasan Basri kehtey hain : Zaid bin Hubab ney Sufiyan Sory sey riwayat ki, aur Sufiyan Sory ney Mansoor sey is hadees ko isi tarah riwayat ki hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"1448","mainey Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha kya padhi. : ameerul-momeneen! kya aap key paas kaghaz mein likhi hui koi aisi tehreer hai jo Quran mein nahin hai? unhoney kaha : nahin, us zaat ki qism jisney daney ko phada aur jaan ko paida kya ! main siwaye us faham o baseerat key jisey Allah Taala Quran key silsiley mein aadmi ko nawazta hai aur us saheefey mein mojud chiz key kuch nahin janta , mainey puchha : saheefa mein kya hai? kaha : is mein diyat , qaidiyon key azad karney ka zikr aur aap ka ye farman hai : '' momin kafir key badley qatl nahin kya jaeyga '' padhi. . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi riwayat hai, 3- baaz ehle-ilm key nazdik isi par amal hai, Sufiyan Sory, Malik bin Anas, Shafai , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai, ye log kehtey hain : momin kafir key badley nahin qatl kya jaeyga, 4- aur baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : zimmi key badley bator qisaas musalman ko qatl kya jaeyga, lekin pehla qol ziyada sahih hai."
"1449","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' musalman kafir key badley qisaas mein qatl nahin kya jaeyga'', aur isi sanad sey riwayat hai ke Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''kafir ki diyat momin ki diyat ka nisf hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan hai, 2- Yahudi aur nasrani ki diyat mein ehle-ilm ka ikhtilaf hai, Yahudi aur nasrani ki diyat ki baabat baaz ehle-ilm ka maslak Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey marvi hadees key muwaafiq hai, 3- umr bin abdul-Azeez kehtey hain : Yahudi aur nasrani ki diyat musalman ki diyat ka nisf hai, Ahmed bin Hanbal isi key qaail hain."
"1450","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jo apney ghulam ko qatl kerega hum bhi usey qatl kar dengey aur jo apney ghulam ka kaan, naak kaatega hum bhi uska kaan, naak kaatengey''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan gharib hai, 2- Tabe-een mein sey baaz ehle-ilm ka yehi maslak hai, Ibrahim Nakhai isi key qaail hain, 3- baaz ehle-ilm maslan Hasan Basri aur ata bin abi Ribah waghera kehtey hain : azad aur ghulam key darmiyan qisaas nahin hai, (na qatl karney mein, na hi qatl sey kam zakhm pahunchaney) mein , Ahmed aur Is-haq bin Raahviya ka yehi qol hai, 4- baaz ehle-ilm kehtey hain : agar koi apney ghulam ko qatl kar dey to uskey badley usey qatl nahin kya jaeyga, aur jab doosrey key ghulam ko qatl kerega to usey uskey badley mein qatl kya jaeyga, Sufiyan Sory aur ehle-koofa ka yehi qol hai."
"1451","umr (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey they : diyat ki adaeygi aaqila padhi. par hai, aur biwi apney shohar ki diyat sey meeras mein kuch nahin paey gi, yahan tak ke in ko Suhak bin Sufiyan kilaabi ney bataya ke Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney unhen eik farman likha tha : '' Ashim Zababi ki biwi ko uskey shohar ki diyat sey meeras do''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- ehle-ilm ka isi par amal hai."
"1452","eik aadmi ney eik aadmi ka haath kaat khaya , usney apna haath khincha to daant kaatney waley key dono agley daant toot gaey, wo dono Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key paas apna maamla ley gaey to aap ney farmaya : '' tum mein sey koi apney bhai ko oont key kaatney ki tarah kaat khata hai, tumharey liye koi diyat nahin, phir Allah ney ye aayat nazil ki : (والجروح قصاص) . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees Hasan sahih hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein Yala bin Umayya aur Salma bin Umayya Raziallahu anhuma sey bhi ahadees aai hain aur ye dono bhai hain."
"1453","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney eik aadmi ko tohmat padhi. ki bina par qaid kya, phir (ilzam Sabit na honey par) usko riha kar diya. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- is baab mein Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi riwayat hai, 2- Behaz bin Hakim bin Muawiya bin Haida Qusheri ki hadees jisey wo apney baap sey aur wo unkey dada sey riwayat kartey hain, Hasan hai, 3- Ismail bin Ibrahim ibne-Uleh ney Behaz bin Hakeem sey ye hadees us sey ziyada mukammal aur lambi riwayat ki hai."
"1454","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo apney maal ki hifazat kartey huye maara jaey wo shaheed hai padhi. aur jisney eik baalisht bhi zamin churaai qiyamat key din usey saat zaminon ka toq pehnaya jaeyga''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- is hadees mein Hatim bin Siyah Maruzi ney izafa kya hai, Maamar kehtey hain : Zohri sey mujhey hadees pahunchi hai, lekin mainey un sey nahin suna ke unhoney is hadees yani (من قتل دون ماله فهو شهيد) '' jo apney maal ki hifazat kartey huye maara jaey wo shaheed hai'' mein kuch izafa kya ho, isi tarah Shuaib bin abu-Hamza ney ye hadees b-tareeq : (الزهري an طلحة بن عبد الله an عبدالرحمٰن بن عمرو بن سهل an سعيد بن زيد an النبي صلى الله عليه وسلم) riwayat ki hai, neez Sufiyan bin Uena ney b-tareeq : (الزهري an طلحة بن عبد الله an سعيد بن زيد an النبي صلى الله عليه"
"1455","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jo apney maal ki hifazat kartey huye maara jaey wo shaheed hai''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- Abdullah bin Amr Raziallahu anhuma ki hadees Hasan hai, ye dusri sanadon sey bhi un sey marvi hai 2- baaz ehle-ilm ney aadmi ko apni jaan o maal ki hifazat key liye difaa ki ijazat di hai, padhi. 3- is bab mein Ali, Saeed bin Zaid, abu-Huraira, ibne-Umar, ibne-Abbas aur Jabir (Raziallauh anhum) sey bhi ahadees aai hain, 4- Abdullah bin Mubarak kehtey hain : aadmi apney maal ki hifazat key liye difaa karey chahey uska maal do dirham hi kyon na ho."
"1456","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''jis aadmi ka maal nahaq chheena jaey aur wo uski hifazat key liye difaa karta huwa maara jaey to wo shaheed hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. is sanad sey bhi Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas Raziallahu anhuma ney Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah riwayat ki hai."
"1457","mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna : ''jo apney maal ki hifazat kartey huye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, jo apney Deen ki hifazat kartey huye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai, jo apni jaan ki hifazat ki khatir maara jaey wo shaheed hai aur jo apney ehal o ayaal ki hifazat kartey huye qatl kya jaey wo shaheed hai ''. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Ibrahim bin Saad sey kaee raawiyon ney usi jaisi hadees riwayat ki hai."
"1458","Abdullah bin Sehal bin Zaid aur Mahisa bin Masood bin Zaid Raziallahu anhuma kahin janey key liye ghar sey rawana huye, jab wo khaibar pahunchey to alag-alag raaston par ho gaey, phir Mahisa ney Abdullah bin Sehal ko maqtool paya , kisi ney in ko qatl kar diya tha, aap ney unhen dafna diya, phir wo ( yani Raavi hadees ( Huwesa bin Masood aur Abdur-Rehman bin Sehal Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki khidmat mein hazir huye, Abdur-Rehman bin Sehal un mein sab sey chhotey they, wo apney dono sathiyon sey pehley (us maamley mein aap sey) baat karna chahtey they, Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney un sey farmaya : ''badey ka lihaz karo, lihaza wo khamosh ho gaey aur unkey dono sathiyon ney guftgu ki, phir wo bhi un dono key sath shareek-e-guftgu ho gaey, un logon ney Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey Abdullah bin Sehal key qatl ka waqia bayan kya, aap ney un sey farmaya : '' kya tum log pachas qasmen khaaogey (ke fulan ney usko qatl kya hai) taake tum apney sathi key khoon baha key mustahiq ho jaao (ya kaha) qatil key khoon key mustahiq ho jaao?'' un logon ney arz kya : hum qism kaisey khaeyn jabke hum hazir nahin they? aap ney farmaya : '' to Yahud pachas qasmen kha kar tum sey bari ho jaeyngey'', un logon ney kaha : hum kafir qom ki qism kaisey qubul kar lein ? phir Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney jab ye maamla dekha to un ki diyat padhi. khud ada kar di. is sanad sey bhi Sehal bin abu Hasma aur Raafey bin khadeej sey isi tarah usi maana ki hadees marvi hai. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai, 2- Qasama key silsiley mein baaz ehle-ilm ka usi hadees par amal hai, 3- Madina key baaz fuqaha Qasama padhi. ki bina par qisaas durust samajhtey hain, 4- koofa key baaz ehle-ilm aur kuch doosrey log kehtey hain : Qasama ki bina par qisaas wajib nahin, sirf diyat wajib hai."
"1459","Abu Musa (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw shkhs hmaray khlaf aslhh athayay"""""
"1460","Jundab (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh ﷺ kw frmatay sna: \n\sahr ky sza tlwar ka ayk war hay۔\"""""""
"1461","Hazrat Umar (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Jise tum Allah ki raaste mein ghaneemat mein chori karte pao"""""
"1462","Hazrat Ibn Abbas (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \n\Agar kisi aadmi doosre aadmi se kahay: 'Ai Yahudi!' to uss ko maar kar bees (20) lagao. Aur agar kahay: 'Ai mukhannath (narmina mard)!' to bhi uss ko bees (20) lagao. Aur jo shakhs kisi mahram ke sath sambandh rakhey"","" to uss ko qatal kardo.\"""""""
"1463","Abu Burdah bin Niyar (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \ksy kw ds kwrwn say zyadh kwray nhyn lgayay jayyn gay swayay an hdwd kay jw allh ky mqrr krdh hdwd hyn۔\"""""""
